{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21277","headline":"酬杨司业十二兄早秋述情见寄 · 元稹","name":"酬杨司业十二兄早秋述情见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白发故人少，相逢意弥远。\n往事共销沈，前期各衰晚。\n昨来遇弥苦，已复云离巘。\n秋草古胶庠，寒沙废宫苑。\n知心岂忘鲍，咏怀难和阮。\n壮志日萧条，那能竞朝幰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21277.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21277","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}